    {
    "title": "Contact Us",
    "content": "If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at privacy@yourcompany.com or through our contact/support page. Our team is committed to responding to inquiries promptly and addressing any concerns regarding your personal data."
